Cell["\<\
I have to rework it: instead of contracting time slice by time slice, I use \
the definitions of each propagators with general space-time coordinates\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986957398122549*^9, 
  3.986957457645628*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3ad61c2d-5b96-614b-a3dc-\
